      "mergeID": "6331e422decc3d50627acf75",
      "mergedPostDetails": "# Issue:\nRight now a lot of options which were added to the Quick Menu because the new Main Menu wasn't ready yet are still in the Quick Menu. Options which don't need Quick Access don't need to be in the Quick Menu because they take up a lot of space.\n# Suggestion:\nMove the following options from the Quick Menu over to the Main Menu:\n- MM Placement\n- Slider Snapping\n- Gesture Icons\n- Home Instance Type\n- Portal Prompt\n- Auto Disable Cloning\n- Limit Particles\n- Mirror Resolution\n- Chatbox (not sure, could also stay in the Quick Menu)\nI think a few things could also be moved / added from the Main Menu to the Quick Menu:\n- Allow Cloning (often you just quickly want to turn it on / off so someone can clone your Avatar)\nThese could probably also be moved to the Quick Menu and put together with the `Comfort Mode` into one category so you can quickly change your Comfort Settings.\n- Comfort Turning\n- Personal Space",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1236] Some Quick Menu setting should now be moved to the Main Menu",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "63194c46d042b344ab331773",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 2
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "IMO, every setting from the quick menu should be in the main menu, and only a small subset of items from the main menu should be in the quick menu.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
