      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There's way too much in the Quick and Radial menus, ALL settings need to be accessible in the Main menu, and some removed from Quick and Radial. Do we need OSC/Debug/Physbone in the Radial menu? no, it's way too cluttered and hard to use the radial menu at this point, having to navigate up and down submenus to get to the mirror, gestures, expressions, and everything else.\nEDIT: And when I say ALL settings I mean everything, people with stick drift find it hard to access settings in the radial menu.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
