  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With all the new features that VRChat has added in the last month, it has added alot of toggles and options and has clogged up the quick menu quite alot. I get why this was done at the time because there isn't a point in adding a button to a menu that is about to be phased out, but now that we got the new menu some of the things should be moved. For example, stuff like Mirror Resolution, Particle Blocking and automatically disabling cloning. These things are things that aren't going to be accesed frequently and only make it harder to find the stuff you would change frequently, and should be moved to the main menu.",
